                                "sense_id": "0ec719d8-44b4-3e7b-a761-8df771b3299a",
                                "text": "Earth writes from the point of view of \" 'Baylor' the Taler of Behler the Failer\" who tells Scheherazade's story (to Death, her \"familiar stranger\") of Somebody's last voyage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc186c26-027d-4a6d-952f-775556e95844",
                                "sense_id": "0ec719d8-44b4-3e7b-a761-8df771b3299a",
                                "text": "She had a series of aliases: “longa mariona wode alias Birde alias taler” [long Mariona Wode, alias Birdie, alias taler, perhaps tale teller]."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
